        "original_id": "1eee42a5-34d7-5da2-8517-916594b231a9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Series: Auction Kings, Pawn Stars\n- People: Lori Verderame\n- Companies: Gallery 63, History Channel, Discovery Channel\n- Places: Sandy Springs, Georgia, Roswell Road, Atlanta\n\nFacts:\n- Pawn Stars debuted on July 26, 2009.\n- Pawn Stars became the History Channel's highest-rated show and the No. 2 reality show behind Jersey Shore.\n- Auction Kings premiered on October 26, 2010.\n- Auction Kings capitalized on the success of Pawn Stars.\n- Auction Kings featured Gallery 63, an auction house on Roswell Road in Sandy Springs, Georgia, just north of the Atlanta city limit.\n- Gallery 63 is now defunct.\n- Lori Verderame is the main appraiser on Auction Kings.\n- Auction Kings airs internationally on Discovery Channel.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
